      "text": "elders to receive license by vote of Church, D&C 20:63. vote required for ordination in Church, D&C 20:65–66. all things to be done by common consent, D&C 26:2 (28:13). men to be appointed by voice of Church, D&C 38:34. Edward Partridge to be appointed bishop by voice of Church, D&C 41:9. transgressors to be accounted unworthy by voice of Church, D&C 51:4. let all things be done by united consent, D&C 104:21. nothing to be taken from treasury except by voice or common consent of order, D&C 104:64, 71–72. fill all these offices and approve of those names, D&C 124:144.",
